1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,950
Onlayn do‘kon ochish qiyinmi?

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:03,600
SavdoGO bilan — 5 daqiqada tayyor!

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,700
Biznes turini tanlang — do‘koningiz o‘zi yig‘iladi.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,600
Restoran, gullar, mebel — har qanday biznes uchun.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,300
Mijozlaringiz uchun — ilovadek qulay.

6
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:19,500
Buyurtma, tushum va kuryerlar — hammasi bir joyda.

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,400
Birinchi 10 kun — bepul! Karta kerak emas.

8
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,700
Keyin oyiga atigi 199 000 so‘m.

9
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,700
savdogo.uz — do‘koningizni bugun oching!
